<description>&lt;p&gt;Somalia is maintaining neutrality as Ethiopia-Eritrea tensions rise while preparing to host talks in Egypt with Eritrea, Sudan and its own leaders, and it has deepened defence ties by agreeing to acquire Pakistani JF-17 fighter jets. The federal government is screening travelers after Kenya confirmed an imported Ebola case and is seeking to repair ties with the UAE despite Somaliland tensions. Somali forces killed two al-Shabaab militants in the Bay region and continue to combat piracy, with Pakistani sailors freed from pirate attacks returning home. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPS1lGdEhPYlFsbkhHbjdBMHZ6TXhaWklJWDZ5b0ZOS05fWUt1b3RjMFpadlAweUIweVlLU05jLW82UzY4QnpCTnRtalI0QkdhQlBLTHhfb1RiUXRQOHdVdDZtOTZ4V0RDZTJvcTZvQkRxZ3EyeXdaLU1lMWd2c0lqRHA5QkJiY2xnMmlWVkJhS1dtdlo5Znc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Shabelle Media Network&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPcVhta2w4UlRHaEVsQXptaThwUVVqY0JQN1d0VW5IYlNkcERWYVJWOTFuRUZLZVhRN21kM1I5QUJ5V1o1eTJncUxWZC1ZWmVncXppTUZnMGx5aG12ZVg3VjRuMlJibERCM0U4a0pKcFUxZlh5emJLWmVRaW1OM21HUlhUUXdrOEhQcW9zc1lucE5iSmxpUG1DbjdzV3ZvTTdjQ3praVFRV1c0N1JELXB5QVJtdXBEaXZiTW15OA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQRHVwT0pscVYtVUtsN2xtX1pocG5kX2ZqZGNDVGpiZzdjLVpkV0pRbEFxYkFuXzM1a0tXanNXMnIySVNZUHpOb1hMZlNBSlQ2eS1aTEhTSG1WX0l3aVJyYzZkUzJOb3E1b0JPZVJBd29rX2JWd1BtdUV2MmJlWXVRRUV4dThWdkp1emZMVmdycUdNalFvNlpsYVE5RGo5VG1aQkJfUGlxc2NPUnlqOFpjaV9nTGdPSTg0dkFxeXAzZTgyUGtyYWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;ht